    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Catherine MacLellan is bringing together two of her favourite songwriters, Rachael Kilgour and Lucy Farrell,  for an evening of songs, stories, open hearts and laughter.   Catherine MacLellan is a JUNO award winner, ECMA songwriter of the year, and has released 7 albums over the past 20 years while touring around the world. She makes her …"
      }
