        "@value": "The Wonder of it All - Victoria Playhouse"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "After 25 years together, Kingsley and Charmaine find themselves questioning the future of their marriage when an unexpected surprise from the past disrupts their lives. Starring Stratford Festival veterans Mark Weatherley and his real-life wife, PEI native Monique Lund, The Wonder of it All is a witty, touching comedy about love and rediscovery."
      }
    ],
